(7693824, 1260920, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether this is about feet, but you made something special out of something that could have been just a portrait of a child. Made me laugh, what we do to our dogs/children, ha ha ha, and nobody feels awkward here. Made me think of Martin Parr. I suggest to crop of 10% of the top of the image to concentrate the view more.</td>', 'Not sure whether this is about feet, but you made something special out of something that could have been just a portrait of a child. Made me laugh, what we do to our dogs/children, ha ha ha, and nobody feels awkward here. Made me think of Martin Parr. I suggest to crop of 10% of the top of the image to concentrate the view more.', '2021-05-09 04:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693833, 1261244, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective!</td>', 'Love the perspective!', '2021-05-09 11:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693834, 1260890, 65234, '<td valign="top">And very detailed webbed feet, at that. Nicely done.</td>', 'And very detailed webbed feet, at that. Nicely done.', '2021-05-09 11:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
