(7694083, 1260973, 65234, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the explanation :-) Very cool that you got all the images, especially the foreground ones, spaced out the way you did. I can just imagine misjudging distances and ending up with weird spacing.</td>', 'Thanks for the explanation :-) Very cool that you got all the images, especially the foreground ones, spaced out the way you did. I can just imagine misjudging distances and ending up with weird spacing.', '2021-05-12 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7694085, 1260973, 4008, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MaryO:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for the explanation :-) Very cool that you got all the images, especially the foreground ones, spaced out the way you did. I can just imagine misjudging distances and ending up with weird spacing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Note: it is just one single image, no composition of multiple images. But you are right, spacing out the feet was a challenge. Also to make all these steps within 30 seconds was a challenge. I made 15 takes in total, after some initial shots to get the framing and exposure right. I did put two shoes at the opposite angles of the triangle from the camera, so I knew the borders of the frame.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-05-12 11:46:19.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by MaryO: Thanks for the explanation :-) Very cool that you got all the images, especially the foreground ones, spaced out the way you did. I can just imagine misjudging distances and ending up with weird spacing.   Note: it is just one single image, no composition of multiple images. But you are right, spacing out the feet was a challenge. Also to make all these steps within 30 seconds was a challenge. I made 15 takes in total, after some initial shots to get the framing and exposure right. I did put two shoes at the opposite angles of the triangle from the camera, so I knew the borders of the frame.', '2021-05-12 08:17:08.000000', '2021-05-12 12:46:19.000000', 0),
(7694094, 1261252, 60581, '<td valign="top">This was one of my fav in the challenge, different and good take on the shot!</td>', 'This was one of my fav in the challenge, different and good take on the shot!', '2021-05-12 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 0),
